Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:52.38,STAFF,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\c&H242424&\pos(525.771,610.8)} · 最好选择与环境相符的平常服饰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:52.38,STAFF,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\c&H242424&\pos(351.333,752)} · 学会看脸色
